-Right here!

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:37.504
-Let's do this, buddy! Let's go!
-All right.

00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:42.509
-Come on, man.
There's your cooler right there.

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:45.145
